# Claude runtime state emitted when compatibility probes retain their fixture root.
# The committed evidence keeps the deliberate config snapshot and proof artifacts,
# but not machine-specific project memory or session caches.
plans/compatibility-testing/evidence/*/fixture-root/claude-config-dir/projects/
plans/compatibility-testing/evidence/*/fixture-root/claude-config-dir/sessions/
